   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The River Song**: back after 329 archived shows (7309 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **1 Samuel 15:23**: back after 47 archived shows (566 days) [4]\n- **Wolf Count**: back after 37 archived shows (412 days) [4]\n- **Wage Wars Get Rich Die Handsome**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2023-07-07.sbd.matrix** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 119 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer finds the matrix recording strikingly good-sounding [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No Children Jazz [1]\n- Seated audience, unusual for the band, stayed fairly relaxed until the encore [1]\n- The band had never played Eau Claire before this night [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2023-07-07.sbd.matrix**: taped by roffels; source: On stage mics Nakamichi CM-300-Sony PCM A-10 (96 khz 24-bit) Soundboard: Zoom f6 (96 khz 32-bit) FOB mics: Nakamichi CM-1000 CP-3 Omni mics-Zoom f6 (96 khz… [1]. Also: Recorded with on-stage Nakamichi mics, a soundboard feed and front-of-board omni mics, synced and mastered as 96kHz 24-bit FLAC [1]",
